<title>EGYPT: Egyptian overnight rates narrow, one-week widen.</title>
<headline>Egyptian overnight rates narrow, one-week widen.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound narrowed in the private sector market on Wednesday to between 10 1/8 and 10 3/16 percent compared to Tuesday's 10 and 10 1/4 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates widened to 10 1/4 and 10 1/2 against 10 1/4 and 10 3/8 percent on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Public-sector banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
